    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0What is Urami-chan?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this &quot;life-intervention watching game,&quot; you control the earthbound spirit &quot;Urami-chan.&quot; Travel between an apartment's past and present to change the murdered resident's future. The game unfolds in semi-real time, tasking you to watch over the resident and intervene.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0The Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >December 31, 1988. Due to the murder of a resident \u201cMs. Noroi\u201d in one of her apartment rooms, the apartment was in danger of being demolished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was a story that was no stranger to \u201cUrami-chan,\u201d the earthbound spirit in her room. Jishibei spirits disappear when they no longer have a place to call their own. With the advice of the human spirit \u201cOnebii,\u201d she returned to the past and took action to change Noroi's future.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0How to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One month from the time Ms. Noroi moved in until she was murdered. The player returns to the past from the calendar of the room where the murder took place and intervenes in Ms. Noroi's life for three hours until the resident, Ms. Noroi, returns home and goes to bed, to make her presence known.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What \u201cUrami-chan\u201d can do</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >call</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000Punching furniture and fixtures can bring Ms. Noroi in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000If Ms. Noroi is concentrated, he may not notice.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818090/extras/972dc5d229cde9587e94281d65172d37.poster.avif?t=1754279472\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818090/extras/972dc5d229cde9587e94281d65172d37.webm?t=1754279472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818090/extras/972dc5d229cde9587e94281d65172d37.mp4?t=1754279472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >telekinesis</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000The spirit power can be used to possess or manipulate the furniture.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818090/extras/afea743b5a06690ed26c855a9231959c.poster.avif?t=1754279472\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818090/extras/afea743b5a06690ed26c855a9231959c.webm?t=1754279472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818090/extras/afea743b5a06690ed26c855a9231959c.mp4?t=1754279472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818090/extras/8ea6c5ce4d56b5543d618627178ac556.poster.avif?t=1754279472\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818090/extras/8ea6c5ce4d56b5543d618627178ac556.webm?t=1754279472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818090/extras/8ea6c5ce4d56b5543d618627178ac556.mp4?t=1754279472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Game Flow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After 3 hours, the player returns to the original time, and if something changes, the date to return is updated. By using telekinesis to cause small \u201canomalies\u201d at first, the past is gradually changed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of \u201canomalies\u201d that can be triggered will increase as the player gains experience by surprising Ms. Noroi. If you can make a big change in the past, might you be able to change your own future?</p>",
